{"id":"wb-6-526","name":"赵用贤宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"赵用贤宅","text":"赵用贤宅位于中国江苏省苏州常熟市南赵弄，今为虞山派古琴艺术馆。\n\n赵用贤（1535年～1596年），官至吏部左侍郎，与子赵琦美均为藏书家。赵用贤宅原有三路，现存中路门屋、前厅、后堂及前庭东侧的藏书厅“脉望馆”。宅内木雕及苏式彩画俱精美。\n\n脉望馆与钱谦益绛云楼和毛晋汲古阁齐名，是明代江南地区的著名藏书楼。“脉望”得名自《酉阳杂俎》所载的：“据《仙经》曰：蠹鱼三食神仙字，则化为此物，名曰脉望”。赵琦美死后，据说脉望馆藏书都进了钱谦益的绛云楼。赵琦美曾将楼中所藏书目编为《脉望馆书目》。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B5%E7%94%A8%E8%B4%A4%E5%AE%85","revisionId":90154164,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90154164","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c0792aec7ff8617845fc233e.jpg","title":"Former_Residence_of_Zhao_Yongxian_04_2014-10.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_Residence_of_Zhao_Yongxian_04_2014-10.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/Former_Residence_of_Zhao_Yongxian_04_2014-10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​赵用贤宅，门屋外侧。","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}